{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Out of Order",
    "steam_appid": 1618330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/965e6915febc54718b78ce1b1e921b81.poster.avif?t=1736206728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/965e6915febc54718b78ce1b1e921b81.webm?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/965e6915febc54718b78ce1b1e921b81.mp4?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colours rise up from the ground, unordered, on spawner towers. You must quickly sort them and make sure they don\u2019t go down into the wrong tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/d66186505602f8a6ad14ea5b9905ee3d.poster.avif?t=1736206728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/d66186505602f8a6ad14ea5b9905ee3d.webm?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/d66186505602f8a6ad14ea5b9905ee3d.mp4?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once arranged correctly, you\u2019ll be rewarded with coins. Use these coins to buy items from the shop. Items make completing levels much easier. Higher rounds yield cheaper items and more coins. How many rounds will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/36cd3b8155a2cf9b4a168eed190e4576.avif?t=1736206728\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Up to 4 players shared screen locally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Endless Procedural Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Map editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Create colour schemes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Upgrade skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discover Pets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Purchase Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Alternative keyboard layouts supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several control schemes, of which you can combine in any way you like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- AZERTY / QWERTZ keyboards are supported. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Controls prompts for xbox / PS available (press left shoulder)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Connect up to 4 controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RMB + LMB + Scrollwheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD + E + SPACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IJKL + O + ENTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrow keys + SHIFT + M</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Axis + START + A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Ability to entirely customise the palettes used ingame</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Can disable camera shake, rapid camera movements, photosensitive mode, plus change camera speed in settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 Different volume controls to give further control to filter out any particular noises that are bothersome</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/965e6915febc54718b78ce1b1e921b81.poster.avif?t=1736206728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/965e6915febc54718b78ce1b1e921b81.webm?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/965e6915febc54718b78ce1b1e921b81.mp4?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colours rise up from the ground, unordered, on spawner towers. You must quickly sort them and make sure they don\u2019t go down into the wrong tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/d66186505602f8a6ad14ea5b9905ee3d.poster.avif?t=1736206728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/d66186505602f8a6ad14ea5b9905ee3d.webm?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/d66186505602f8a6ad14ea5b9905ee3d.mp4?t=1736206728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once arranged correctly, you\u2019ll be rewarded with coins. Use these coins to buy items from the shop. Items make completing levels much easier. Higher rounds yield cheaper items and more coins. How many rounds will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618330/extras/36cd3b8155a2cf9b4a168eed190e4576.avif?t=1736206728\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Up to 4 players shared screen locally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Endless Procedural Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Map editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Create colour schemes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Upgrade skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discover Pets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Purchase Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Alternative keyboard layouts supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several control schemes, of which you can combine in any way you like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- AZERTY / QWERTZ keyboards are supported. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Controls prompts for xbox / PS available (press left shoulder)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Connect up to 4 controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RMB + LMB + Scrollwheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD + E + SPACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IJKL + O + ENTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrow keys + SHIFT + M</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Axis + START + A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Ability to entirely customise the palettes used ingame</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Can disable camera shake, rapid camera movements, photosensitive mode, plus change camera speed in settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 Different volume controls to give further control to filter out any particular noises that are bothersome</p>",
    "short_description": "New colours are constantly spawning - sort them faster than they arrive to win the round. Survive variations, purchase items, and even discover pets! Supports up to 4 local players.",
